  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-brendan-intro-html-fish-ae3b36a5-5166-4513-be8e-ddc4fa658e3e",
        "text": "Ever wonder how websites like your favorite game's page or a funny animal video site are made? Today, we're diving into the exciting world of web pages!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/fd7ef57cee46b02f496e39309006daa7-test-brendan-intro-html-fish-panel-1-eeee1e92-25e8-47ab-afee-f981a6f94713.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-brendan-intro-html-fish-2e6f2870-9428-4094-b1e0-74efcaaf3fb7",
        "text": "We'll start with HTML, which stands for HyperText Markup Language. Think of HTML as the *bones* or *structure* of a web page, telling your computer exactly what content to show.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c362c44c095d70ee3271d979bfe9b30d-test-brendan-intro-html-fish-panel-2-59fc29bc-a111-4cd7-8347-4669f7de44f6.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-brendan-intro-html-fish-35ddf3a7-579d-42a7-b294-c3dd55abfb88",
        "text": "By the end of this lesson, you'll create your very own web page, all about your fantastic pet fish! Get ready to share your finned friend with the world.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/7e9ed7d678b2481a0129a48a0c896d7f-test-brendan-intro-html-fish-panel-3-9bd77f8f-c51d-4998-bf40-6e48967842fb.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Welcome to the world of web pages! In this lesson, you'll learn the basic building blocks of a web page using HTML. We'll start by understanding what HTML is and how it helps us tell the computer what to display. Get ready to make a web page about your pet fish!"
  },
